# The setup firmware: WiFi set up from a phone on the knob's own hotspot, and
# then the firmware for the knob's radio chosen on the dial and installed
# (VFO_RADIO=setup). For a knob with no computer to set it up from.
#
# WiFi only, without the USB networking of sdkconfig.usbnet: the hotspot and
# the station are the whole of its networking, and leaving TinyUSB out keeps
# the serial console on the cable.
